# Builder: Audit handoff gate (every time)

You are **Builder #1**, not Audit. When coordinator pastes a **BUILDER HANDOFF**, do **not** implement until you pass this gate.

## Step 1 — Read logs yourself (mandatory)

Do not trust Audit's summary. Read from disk:

- `...\reframework\data\quest_tracker_log.txt` (first 80 lines + grep errors/gather/wiki-gap/layout)
- `...\re2_framework_log.txt` (if errors claimed)
- `...\reframework\data\quest_tracker_prefs.json`
- `...\reframework\data\quest_tracker_last_layout.json` (if layout issue)

Confirm log `mod loaded vX.Y.Z` matches workspace `MOD_VERSION`. If mismatch → **STOP**: tell coordinator Fluffy install stale, not a Builder fix.

## Step 2 — Audit handoff quality checklist

**REJECT** (reply `AUDIT REJECTED — re-run full pass`, implement nothing) if ANY missing:

| Required in handoff | Half-ass if missing |
|---------------------|---------------------|
| Log line refs (L## or quoted lines) per P0/P1 | "probably", "might", "user said" only |
| `rebuild #N: list_rows=` with number | rows=0 not explained |
| `restored layout` with source + WxH | only X,Y or no source |
| `[wiki-gap]` count or "zero gaps" | no wiki audit when ongoing tab used |
| Installed version vs workspace | version not cross-checked |
| SKILL.md structural findings (≥1 if files >600 lines implicated) | symptom-only 3-bullet fix list |
| PASS criteria stated OR explicit P0/P1 only | vague "fix window" |
| **AUDIT DEBT** section (OPEN rows from `AUDIT_DEBT.md`) | missing after any prior audit FAIL this session |

## Step 3 — Cross-check Audit claims

For each Audit P0/P1, grep the log yourself. If Audit cites a line that does not exist or misreads it → **REJECT**.

If Audit says PASS but log shows `[QT][ERROR] gather crashed` or `list_rows=0` all session → **REJECT PASS**.

## Step 4 — Only then implement

- Implement **only** items that survived cross-check.
- Do not add Audit's "nice to have" or structural refactors unless handoff marks P0/P1.
- After ship: `_ship_check.ps1` + `_wipe_game_logs.ps1 -Version X.Y.Z`.

## Reply when rejecting

```
AUDIT REJECTED — incomplete handoff
Missing: [bullets]
Builder read log: [MOD_VERSION, list_rows, errors, layout line]
Coordinator: send Audit 1 back for full pass (thermo-nuclear-audit-every-time.mdc + SKILL.md).
No code changes made.
```
